      "text": "Q1: Custom AppError + 404 + Global Handler",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Q1: Custom AppError + 404 + Global Handler",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a2"
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 31676,
      "version": 19,
      "versionNonce": 1320696272,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795163433547,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "t3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 165,
      "width": 688.7532454911051,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "Build a class AppError extends Error (message, statusCode,\nisOperational).\n1. GET /users/:id -> if id isn't numeric, throw AppError(\"Invalid id\",\n400).\n2. If user not found, throw AppError(\"User not found\", 404).\n3. Add a catch-all middleware (app.use) for unknown routes -> 404\nAppError.\n4. Add a 4-arg global handler (err, req, res, next) returning\n   { status: \"fail\"|\"error\", message }.\nTest: /users/abc -> 400, /users/999 -> 404, /nope -> 404.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Build a class AppError extends Error (message, statusCode, isOperational).\n1. GET /users/:id -> if id isn't numeric, throw AppError(\"Invalid id\", 400).\n2. If user not found, throw AppError(\"User not found\", 404).\n3. Add a catch-all middleware (app.use) for unknown routes -> 404 AppError.\n4. Add a 4-arg global handler (err, req, res, next) returning\n   { status: \"fail\"|\"error\", message }.\nTest: /users/abc -> 400, /users/999 -> 404, /nope -> 404.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a3"
    },
