      "height": 30,
      "text": "Q2: Async Errors with catchAsync wrapper",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Q2: Async Errors with catchAsync wrapper",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a5"
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 55433,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 2142390576,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795163261395,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "t6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 495,
      "width": 651.2,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "Async handlers that throw don't reach Express 4's handler by default.\n1. Write catchAsync(fn) => (req,res,next) => fn(req,res,next).catch(next).\n2. Create POST /orders that awaits a fake DB call (setTimeout promise)\n   that rejects randomly with Error(\"DB down\").\n3. Wrap the handler with catchAsync (no try/catch inside the handler!).\n4. Global handler: for non-operational errors return 500 and a generic\n   \"Something went wrong\", and console.error the real error.\nBonus: handle unhandledRejection and uncaughtException on process.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Async handlers that throw don't reach Express 4's handler by default.\n1. Write catchAsync(fn) => (req,res,next) => fn(req,res,next).catch(next).\n2. Create POST /orders that awaits a fake DB call (setTimeout promise)\n   that rejects randomly with Error(\"DB down\").\n3. Wrap the handler with catchAsync (no try/catch inside the handler!).\n4. Global handler: for non-operational errors return 500 and a generic\n   \"Something went wrong\", and console.error the real error.\nBonus: handle unhandledRejection and uncaughtException on process.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a6"
    },
