      "height": 30,
      "text": "Q3: Dev vs Prod Errors + Known Error Types",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Q3: Dev vs Prod Errors + Known Error Types",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a8"
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 79190,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 215050192,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795163261395,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "t9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 825,
      "width": 633.6,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "Make the global handler behave differently by NODE_ENV.\n1. Development: send message, stack, and full error object.\n2. Production: send only a clean message for operational errors;\n   generic 500 for unknown ones.\n3. Convert known errors into AppError:\n   - Mongoose/JSON: invalid JSON body (SyntaxError, express.json) -> 400\n   - Duplicate key (code 11000) -> 409\n   - JsonWebTokenError -> 401, TokenExpiredError -> 401\n4. Test each by sending bad JSON, a fake error with code 11000,\n   and a bad JWT to a protected route.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Make the global handler behave differently by NODE_ENV.\n1. Development: send message, stack, and full error object.\n2. Production: send only a clean message for operational errors;\n   generic 500 for unknown ones.\n3. Convert known errors into AppError:\n   - Mongoose/JSON: invalid JSON body (SyntaxError, express.json) -> 400\n   - Duplicate key (code 11000) -> 409\n   - JsonWebTokenError -> 401, TokenExpiredError -> 401\n4. Test each by sending bad JSON, a fake error with code 11000,\n   and a bad JWT to a protected route.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a9"
    },
